# Files excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# tools/ holds internal notes and scripts - including OFFPAGE-GUIDE.md, which
# discusses the Hong Kong entity route and the NAP conflict between the
# registered address and the address published on the site. Those files were
# reachable at /tools/... on the live domain. Excluding them here means they are
# never uploaded, so the URLs return 404 at the CDN.
#
# They stay in git; nothing on the site references them.
tools/
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.vercelignore
*.md
